\subsection{Indoor Datasets}

Indoor benchmarks remain significantly less abundant:

\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{S3DIS} \cite{Armeni2016S3DIS}: the most widely adopted benchmark for indoor semantic segmentation.

\item \textbf{3DSES} \cite{Merizette2025ThreeDSES}: recent industrial indoor dataset designed to support semantic segmentation research.

